      "observed": "The servo power rail Net-(D2-K) is bypassed to GND by only three 100 µF capacitors, C1, C3, and C4. There is no C2 component in the netlist or SPICE deck.",
      "expected": "The specification requires a bank of four 100 µF capacitors, C1–C4, on the servo power rail downstream of D2.",
      "evidence": [
        {
