          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"33\") (name \"Net-(D2-K)\") (class \"Default\")\n      (node (ref \"C1\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"passive\"))\n      (node (ref \"C3\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\"))\n      (node (ref \"C4\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"passive\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "C4 0 Net-_D2-K_ 100u\nC3 Net-_D2-K_ 0 100u\nC1 0 Net-_D2-K_ 100u"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The servo rail has only 300 µF of bulk capacitance instead of the intended 400 µF, reducing buffering against PWM servo inrush current and making brown-out or unexpected shutdown more likely.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The connectivity and component values otherwise match the specified architecture, but the required four-capacitor servo bulk bank is missing C2, leaving only C1, C3, and C4 on the servo power rail."
}

